            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015382+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "Hospitals today use a \"blowby\" apparatus for this purpose.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015382+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8191",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8191",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8191",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:b140dcf4ab61a79dd3b1429e39d31c13374c91a4e3c51fe1b0536a47eab8ed6a",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015383+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "Rain caused cancellation of the event in 1877, so enforcement of the new law had to wait until 1878.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015383+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8306",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8306",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8306",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:60f8e05c264fe3f37362facd851bf099f00a6e3c70f1e33aa57f9632441b1255",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015390+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "I read the report from Somalia on the agreement reached by faction leaders on the form of a future government that has been warmly welcomed.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015390+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8436",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8436",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8436",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:93accac942fda8944e8b20d4a4ee6a81c3ddc1d1ee0eeff8468190008425f296",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015398+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "In 2006 we reported on a robotic hand that formed rock, paper, scissors gestures by reading a human subject's mind via an MRI scanner.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015398+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8948",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-8948",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8948",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:cdde806ce00ee1207fe9406c22f0293b5d2011e66d860fbb178f7fa737d77648",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015406+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "It has been asserted in the literature that the recognition of speech takes place not because of phonemic distinctions only.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015406+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9270",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9270",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9270",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:61c957251aa1b8522704d868c76cd5e90f97da551a4c743a82bc100888c54a2d",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015407+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "In the sequence, the raven looks on as the witch stirs the cauldron with a huge bone.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015407+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9586",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9586",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9586",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:5135d7cc6e863bd474de18854cf2a155bfb51dac5ff0b8f06ea169115be1a453",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015415+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "All LibriVox recordings have been released into the public domain.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015415+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9599",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9599",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9599",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:f4639f7e1b1e5f7629eabe262e68da60f958e3257ec5de8782acb10b9999b58d",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015421+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "Finally, there are the compeers, I mean the character-compeers of all these profligates, whose appearance is truly somewhat different, namely, rags and drunkenness.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015421+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9713",
            "_key": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45-semeval-9713",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9713",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:e0adde7f292e71fa1266c80ba7888bced06d3dca39266c8d3e3612d035fea66c",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015427+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r1-b45",
            "text": "Flapping with his wings the duckling quacked for joy.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:41:28.015427+00:00"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
